// Everything that can be caught or dug up — fish, bugs, fossils. Each entry also becomes an item
// (same id, tagged #collection:fish / #collection:bugs / #collection:fossils) and an encyclopedia page.
//
//   kind     fish | bug | fossil
//   place    fish: river · pond · sea;  bugs: flowers · trees · air · ground · rocks · water · beach
//   months   1–12 for the northern hemisphere (the south is shifted by half a year); [] = all year
//   hours    [from, to) in game hours, wraps over midnight ([19, 4] = evening to early morning); omit = all day
//   weather  any | rain | dry
//   rarity   1 (common) … 5 (very rare) — spawn weight comes from the collection config
//   size     fish shadow size 1…6
//   glow     bugs: { color, size, pulse } — a soft light after dark
//   flap     winged bugs: flutter (butterflies) | buzz (bees, dragonflies)
